      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUCKS A LADY (1) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on her sharp win the start prior, getting around this track over 340m in 19.70. Rates a top chance if runs up to time two back. JOJO GIRL (2) led all the way last time out to score by a neck (20.06) at this track in a Grade 5 over 340m. Has definite claims. HARA'S ROCKY (8) was in the minors two back (20.13) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from five attempts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. MY CAPE ESCAPE (6) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
